<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-HEINEKEN TROPHY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HEINEKEN TROPHY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROSMALEN, Netherlands 1997-06-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>Heineken Trophy tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seed):</p>
<p>Women's semi finals:</p>
<p>Miriam Oremans (Netherlands) beat 1-Anke Huber (Germany) 4-6</p>
<p>6-4 - Huber retired injured</p>
